        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudoku Master: A Mind-Engaging Puzzle Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of Sudoku Master, the ultimate game for both puzzle beginners and Sudoku savants! Whether you're seeking a mental workout or a relaxing pastime, Sudoku Master provides an immersive experience, replicating the classic joy of paper-and-pencil Sudoku in a sleek digital format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through various levels, from beginner-friendly puzzles to mind-bending expert challenges. With millions of Sudoku grids across four difficulty settings – easy, medium, hard, and expert – there's a puzzle for every mood and skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudoku Master is crafted with exceptional features to enhance your gameplay. Opt for helpful guides like auto-tracking, automated controls, and duplicate highlights, or embrace the thrill of solving puzzles unaided in our manual mode. The choice is yours – tailor the challenge to your preference!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Auto-Error Detection or Manual Mode for self-spotting mistakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Hints available (with a minor time penalty for a balanced challenge)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 A vast library of puzzles across varied difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Note-taking functionality to strategize and track possible solutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Easy Undo feature for stress-free corrections</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Supports 4x4 Mini Sudoku – perfect for beginners</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Share puzzles with friends to spark a friendly competition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Leaderboards and achievements to see how you rank globally</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Sleek, user-friendly interface for seamless gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Save and load features to pick up right where you left off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your device into a brain-boosting puzzle hub with Sudoku Master. Available for play anytime, anywhere – challenge your intellect and unwind with a grid today!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudoku Master: A Mind-Engaging Puzzle Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of Sudoku Master, the ultimate game for both puzzle beginners and Sudoku savants! Whether you're seeking a mental workout or a relaxing pastime, Sudoku Master provides an immersive experience, replicating the classic joy of paper-and-pencil Sudoku in a sleek digital format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through various levels, from beginner-friendly puzzles to mind-bending expert challenges. With millions of Sudoku grids across four difficulty settings – easy, medium, hard, and expert – there's a puzzle for every mood and skill level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudoku Master is crafted with exceptional features to enhance your gameplay. Opt for helpful guides like auto-tracking, automated controls, and duplicate highlights, or embrace the thrill of solving puzzles unaided in our manual mode. The choice is yours – tailor the challenge to your preference!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Auto-Error Detection or Manual Mode for self-spotting mistakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Hints available (with a minor time penalty for a balanced challenge)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 A vast library of puzzles across varied difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Note-taking functionality to strategize and track possible solutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Easy Undo feature for stress-free corrections</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Supports 4x4 Mini Sudoku – perfect for beginners</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Share puzzles with friends to spark a friendly competition</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Leaderboards and achievements to see how you rank globally</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Sleek, user-friendly interface for seamless gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Save and load features to pick up right where you left off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your device into a brain-boosting puzzle hub with Sudoku Master. Available for play anytime, anywhere – challenge your intellect and unwind with a grid today!</p>",
